    "slug": "simplereadme",
    "title": "Simplereadme",
    "summary": "A template for a clean README (the special repository).",
    "status": "published",
    "visibility": "unlisted",
    "kind": "project",
    "url": "/projects/simplereadme.html",
    "repo_url": "https://github.com/Avery2/SimpleReadme",
    "body": "\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You can add a README to your GitHub profile to tell other people about yourself. (<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/github/setting-up-and-managing-your-github-profile/customizing-your-profile/managing-your-profile-readme\">docs</a>)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">SimpleReadme helps you make a simple yet good looking README. You can use it online <a href=\"http://www.averychan.site/SimpleReadme/\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a> to generate the text for you.</p>\n<details open=\"\">\n<summary>Example Output:</summary>\n<hr/>\n<h1 dir=\"auto\">Hi, I’m Avery 👋</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I’m currently a computer science and data science double major at the University of Wisconsin-Madison. This summer I am working as a developer intern at <a href=\"https://www.halo.science/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Halo Science</a>.</p>\n<div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n\n\n\n\n</div><br/>\n<hr/>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Example Source:</summary>\n<pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\"># Hi, I’m Avery 👋\n\nI’m currently a computer science and data science double major at the University of Wisconsin-Madison. This summer I am working as a developer intern at [Halo Science](https://www.halo.science/).\n\n&lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/avery2\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"LinkedIn\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Justin_Chan-%230077B5.svg?style=flat&amp;logo=linkedin&amp;logoColor=white\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"mailto:justinaverychan@gmail.com\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Email\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/justinaverychan@gmail.com-D14836?style=flat&amp;logo=gmail&amp;logoColor=white\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"https://www.averychan.site\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Website\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?down_color=lightgrey&amp;down_message=offline&amp;label=averychan.site&amp;up_color=green&amp;up_message=online&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.averychan.site\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n    &lt;a href=\"https://www.averychan.site/normal-resume/Justin_Avery_Chan_Resume.pdf\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Resume\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Resume_(last_updated)-Jul_2021-green\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;\n</code></pre>\n</details>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://github.com/Avery2\">my profile</a> in this style.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Instructions (Automatic)</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Create a repository that is the same as your github username <em>(for example: GitHubUser/GitHubUser)</em></li>\n<li>Create a README.md in that repository</li>\n<li>Use the autogenerator <a href=\"http://www.averychan.site/SimpleReadme/\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a> to generate the README text.</li>\n<li>Paste the text into your README</li>\n<li>Done! You can also make any edits you want.</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note: If the link to the tool is ever down you can still use it by downloading this repo and opening index.html locally.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Instructions (Manual)</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Create a repository that is the same as your github username <em>(for example: GitHubUser/GitHubUser)</em></li>\n<li>Create a README.md in that repository</li>\n<li>Add the following text (in \"Raw Text\"), and make replacements as described below (in \"Replacement Instructions\")</li>\n<li>Add your Resume to the respository <em>(optional)</em></li>\n<li>Replace the bio placeholder</li>\n<li>Done! It should show up at your profile.</li>\n</ol>\n<details>\n<summary>Raw Text</summary>\n<pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\"># Hi, I'm FIRST_LAST 👋\n\n**(BIO GOES HERE)**\n\n&lt;div align=\"center\"&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"LINKED_IN_PROFILE_LINK\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"LinkedIn\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FIRST_LAST-%230077B5.svg?style=flat&amp;logo=linkedin&amp;logoColor=white\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"mailto:MY_EMAIL@gmail.com\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Email\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MY_EMAIL@gmail.com-D14836?style=flat&amp;logo=gmail&amp;logoColor=white\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"MY_WEBSITE_URL\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Website\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?down_color=lightgrey&amp;down_message=offline&amp;label=MY_WEBSITE_URL&amp;up_color=green&amp;up_message=online&amp;url=MY_WEBSITE_URL\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n  &lt;a href=\"./PATH_TO_RESUME.pdf\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Resume\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Resume_(last_updated)-TIME_LAST_UPDATED-green\"/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;\n</code></pre>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Replacement Instructions</summary>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Replace the following text. Count included to make sure you get each one.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Text to replace</th>\n<th>Count</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>FIRST_LAST</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Your name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LINKED_IN_PROFILE_LINK</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Link to your LinkedIn profile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MY_EMAIL</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Your email (assumes Gmail extension)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MY_WEBSITE_URL</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Your website URL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PATH_TO_RESUME</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>The path to your resume file (you can add it to this repo)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TIME_LAST_UPDATED</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Last time your Resume was updated. (Ex: \"Jun 2001\")</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</details>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Resources</h2>\n<details>\n<summary>Tools for this README</summary>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Link</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Sheilds.io for the badges</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://shields.io\" rel=\"nofollow\">link</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Other Cool Resources</summary>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Link</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Profile-readme for recent activity</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://github.com/actions-js/profile-readme\">link</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Github-readme-stats for the GitHub stats summary</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://github.com/anuraghazra/github-readme-stats\">link</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Productive-box for pinned gist (below) of commit times</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://github.com/maxam2017/productive-box\">link</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>List of many tools and examples</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://github.com/abhisheknaiidu/awesome-github-profile-readme\">link</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n</details>",
    "project_stats_html": "<div class=\"project-stats\"><span><i class=\"fas fa-code\"></i> JavaScript</span><span><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i> 0</span><span><i class=\"fas fa-code-branch\"></i> 0</span><span><i class=\"fas fa-clock\"></i> Updated Aug 2021</span></div>",
    "project_actions_html": "<div class=\"project-links\"><a class=\"project-link-btn\" href=\"https://github.com/Avery2/SimpleReadme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i class=\"fab fa-github\"></i> View on GitHub</a></div>",
