    "body": "<h1 dir=\"auto\">240 Final Project</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">View online <a href=\"https://avery2.github.io/SpotifyDataAnalysis/\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a>. Data from <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/yamaerenay/spotify-dataset-19212020-160k-tracks?select=data_by_artist_o.csv\" rel=\"nofollow\">here</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The final project for a statistics class (STAT 240) analyzing Spotify data from kaggle. Created with R Markdown.</p>",
